#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:5
#: cdeec330ee364bf0a1ded13589b51217
msgid "Tuning Steering and navigation for a Rover (ver 3.1 and older)"
msgstr "Rover 转向与导航调试（3.1及更早版本）"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:7
#: 1e7b4bc876764d2d83f92fada7b2bdab
msgid "**ARCHIVED**"
msgstr "**已归档**"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:11
#: 1b5f70bbd4cd48e48e754facd79e710a
msgid ""
"These instructions are relevant for Rover-3.1 and older. For newer versions "
"of the Rover firmware please refer to these :ref:`steering <rover-tuning-"
"steering-rate>` and :ref:`navigation tuning guides <rover-tuning-"
"navigation>`."
msgstr ""
"本说明适用于 Rover-3.1 及更早版本。对于更新版本的 Rover 固件，请参考 :ref:`转向 <rover-tuning-steering-"
"rate>` 和 :ref:`导航调试指南 <rover-tuning-navigation>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:15
#: 971c15e554e34cff857d334730774b3c
msgid ""
"When setting up a Rover there are 6 key parameters you need to get right. "
"This guide provides a set of steps to get those parameters right, so that "
"your rover will accurately navigate in AUTO mode."
msgstr "设置 Rover 时，有6个关键参数需要正确设置。本指南提供了一套步骤来正确配置这些参数，使 Rover 能在 Auto 模式下精确导航。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:20
#: d9cdc00b3553479581abb811e3d21bdc
msgid "The key parameters"
msgstr "关键参数"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:22
#: 7f796795d60d4ddf85dcfa034413a247
msgid ""
"``STEER2SRV_P``: This tells the rover code what the turning circle (as a "
"diameter in meters) is for your rover. It is critical that you get this "
"parameter right, as it tells the code what steering angle to choose to "
"achieve a desired turn rate."
msgstr ""
"``STEER2SRV_P``：告知 Rover 代码您的 Rover "
"转弯圆的直径（单位：米）。正确设置此参数至关重要，因为它告知代码应选择什么转向角来实现期望的转向速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:26
#: e25af31466a74923af8ab705a831c0b0
msgid ""
"``TURN_MAX_G``: This tells the rover the maximum G force (in multiples of "
"one gravity) that your rover can handle while remaining stable. If you set "
"this too high then your rover may flip over in turns, or skid. If you set it"
" too low then your rover will not be able to turn sharply enough."
msgstr ""
"``TURN_MAX_G``：告知 Rover 在保持稳定的情况下能承受的最大 G 力（以重力倍数计）。设置过高可能导致 Rover "
"在转弯时翻转或侧滑；设置过低则 Rover 无法进行足够急促的转弯。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:31
#: 8b950d2fa8b24affa707c971a29aef83
msgid ""
"``NAVL1_PERIOD``: This controls the aggressiveness of the navigation "
"algorithm. A smaller number means more aggressive turning in AUTO mode, a "
"large number means larger, smoother turns."
msgstr "``NAVL1_PERIOD``：控制导航算法的激进程度。数值越小，Auto 模式下转弯越激进；数值越大，转弯越宽、越平滑。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:34
#: e2732041939e401abf5940b8cb1b2054
msgid ""
"``SPEED_TURN_GAIN``: This controls how much the rover should slow down while"
" turning, as a percentage of current target speed. To not slow down at all "
"in turns set this to 100. When doing initial tuning it is recommended you "
"use 100, and lower this later to improve handling of tight courses."
msgstr ""
"``SPEED_TURN_GAIN``：控制 Rover "
"转弯时应减速多少，以当前目标速度的百分比表示。设为100表示转弯时完全不减速。初始调试时建议使用100，之后再降低以改善急弯路段的操控。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:39
#: 75eca47d3c354df69aecee1cf4659209
msgid ""
"``CRUISE_SPEED``: This controls the target speed in meters/second in AUTO."
msgstr "``CRUISE_SPEED``：控制 Auto 模式下的目标速度（单位：米/秒）。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:41
#: c81e7bd436f2471da4c2787c2d540af5
msgid ""
"``CRUISE_THROTTLE``: This sets the initial guess at what throttle is needed "
"to achieve CRUISE_SPEED when driving straight ahead. This needs to be "
"**RIGHT** for the rover to achieve good speed control."
msgstr ""
"``CRUISE_THROTTLE``：设置直线行驶时达到 CRUISE_SPEED 所需油门的初始估算值。此参数必须**准确**，才能让 Rover "
"实现良好的速度控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:46
#: e2ce4bf7e5144ed9a339efbd8292f605
msgid "Step 1: Setting initial parameters"
msgstr "第一步：设置初始参数"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:48
#: b6d794454e39477d8617603667413522
msgid "To start the tuning process set the following values:"
msgstr "调试过程开始时，设置以下值："

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:50
#: 34e902a0771d47c39905f90374bccbea
msgid "STEER2SRV_P = 2"
msgstr "STEER2SRV_P = 2"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:51
#: b325ddbf82a74744857f393ce71846e4
msgid "TURN_MAX_G = 1"
msgstr "TURN_MAX_G = 1"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:52
#: c5ad88b494bf4f5a9bbbbde84f1efbe5
msgid "NAVL1_PERIOD = 6"
msgstr "NAVL1_PERIOD = 6"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:53
#: 1e8d1e5bed9744598a70f1b1b96f4919
msgid "SPEED_TURN_GAIN = 100"
msgstr "SPEED_TURN_GAIN = 100"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:54
#: 571fe50f5c204504873044c7373c6d86
msgid "CRUISE_SPEED = 2"
msgstr "CRUISE_SPEED = 2"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:55
#: 8019348586db418c85298c811218d046
msgid "CRUISE_THROTTLE = 20"
msgstr "CRUISE_THROTTLE = 20"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:57
#: 68927b08900641ae97f69b827b559745
msgid ""
"These are conservative values that should give you slow, gentle behaviour "
"for most rovers."
msgstr "这些是保守值，适合大多数 Rover 实现缓慢、温和的行为。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:61
#: b3d659aa58ed431bb0d2fb557b73b1f0
msgid "Step 2: Setting CRUISE_THROTTLE"
msgstr "第二步：设置 CRUISE_THROTTLE"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:63
#: a2bf0275ff8d41fdbe24650363ab53fe
msgid ""
"We need to get ``CRUISE_THROTTLE`` right so we know what throttle level will"
" give us a speed of 2 meters/second."
msgstr "我们需要正确设置 ``CRUISE_THROTTLE``，以便知道哪个油门量对应2米/秒的速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:66
#: 30f77c5cc0714a26bd0a524fdd4fe4d7
msgid "Switch to MANUAL mode"
msgstr "切换到 MANUAL 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:67
#: a2f54da624ce4394b311c9ae70e85455
msgid ""
"Slowly advance the throttle until the ground station shows a speed of 2 "
"meters/second"
msgstr "缓慢增大油门，直到地面站显示速度为2米/秒"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:69
#: 1160a78aa598460fb57a04a7a013e463
msgid "note the throttle percentage shown in the HUD"
msgstr "记录 HUD 中显示的油门百分比"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:70
#: 03499eb8e25b49009f538eea4369927d
msgid ""
"set CRUISE_THROTTLE to the percentage needed for straight driving at 2 "
"meters/second"
msgstr "将 CRUISE_THROTTLE 设置为直线行驶2米/秒所需的百分比"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:74
#: b49eecc10564443483726a96014e18eb
msgid "Step 3: Setting the STEER2SRV_P"
msgstr "第三步：设置 STEER2SRV_P"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:76
#: 7be54bfaa5ef48d4a60b99ca9af557dd
msgid ""
"To set your STEER2SRV_P parameter you need to measure the diameter of the "
"turning circle of your rover."
msgstr "设置 STEER2SRV_P 参数需要测量 Rover 转弯圆的直径。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:79
#: dd9954f8ec88498b956e0de8860b034b
msgid ""
"Put your rover into MANUAL mode, and put the steering hard over to one side."
" Then very slowly drive your rover in a circle. Use a tape measure to "
"measure the diameter of that circle and set STEER2SRV_P to that value in "
"meters."
msgstr ""
"将 Rover 切换到 MANUAL 模式，将转向打到一侧极限，然后以非常缓慢的速度绕圈行驶。用卷尺测量该圆的直径，并将 STEER2SRV_P "
"设置为该值（单位：米）。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:85
#: 6597505dd0644c4997e895d913eeec33
msgid "Step 4: tuning TURN_MAX_G"
msgstr "第四步：调试 TURN_MAX_G"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:87
#: 9d01eea1d64a4524803a23236969d106
msgid ""
"The ``TURN_MAX_G`` parameter can now be tuned so that your rover can drive "
"more aggressively, without turning over."
msgstr "``TURN_MAX_G`` 参数现在可以调整，使 Rover 能更激进地驾驶，而不会翻转。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:90
#: 84305565655e4095a35c6a5a9bfee343
msgid "put into STEERING mode"
msgstr "切换到 STEERING 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:91
#: 32eff2057b8f4b5da22c7ba6ec4d5564
msgid "turn at maximum turn rate and maximum throttle"
msgstr "以最大转向速率和最大油门转弯"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:92
#: b4fbbc2a64fd4e118362069648edac49
msgid ""
"adjust TURN_MAX_G to highest level that rover remains stable, doesn't start "
"to roll over and doesn't skid"
msgstr "将 TURN_MAX_G 调整到 Rover 保持稳定、不开始侧翻且不侧滑的最高水平"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:96
#: 653bd0982a7449de8d09c932050c6d3c
msgid "Step 5: tuning NAVL1_PERIOD"
msgstr "第五步：调试 NAVL1_PERIOD"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:98
#: a80fa0684f4647a2aa486c8da86be0c9
msgid ""
"Now you can finally start tuning your steering in AUTO mode. To tune in AUTO"
" you will need to create a mission for your rover to navigate. A simple "
"rectangular mission is the best to start with."
msgstr "现在可以开始在 Auto 模式下调试转向了。需要为 Rover 创建一个导航任务。简单的矩形任务是最佳起点。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:102
#: 0433245616324c18b8eaacae79f23d2c
msgid "create a rectangular course for the rover"
msgstr "为 Rover 创建矩形航线"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:103
#: 2cdc3d5ab6584f278934bdb17a86b2ac
msgid "run the course in AUTO mode"
msgstr "在 Auto 模式下运行该航线"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:104
#: b43d9a246ec44fa8accd619a7c1c39c6
msgid ""
"if the rover weaves along the straights, then raise NAVL1_PERIOD in "
"increments of 0.5"
msgstr "如果 Rover 在直线路段蛇形行驶，则以0.5为增量提高 NAVL1_PERIOD"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:106
#: f1a4d54c05e3465b9b4b88e9a6009168
msgid ""
"if the rover doesn't turn sharply enough then lower NAVL1_PERIOD in "
"increments of 0.5"
msgstr "如果 Rover 转弯不够急促，则以0.5为增量降低 NAVL1_PERIOD"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:108
#: ab9ad29a227e46ed80efeaf222a942f7
msgid ""
"if the rover is turning too late in corners then raise WP_RADIUS in "
"increments of 1.0"
msgstr "如果 Rover 转弯过晚，则以1.0为增量提高 WP_RADIUS"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:111
#: 7fc88c2ee63f48c09a062f2d4ca3b641
msgid ""
"You may also find that you may need to raise NAVL1_DAMPING slightly to "
"improve navigation in tight courses."
msgstr "您可能还需要适当提高 NAVL1_DAMPING 以改善急弯路段的导航性能。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:115
#: 1607f2022a0643dcb9e73befef75790d
msgid "Final Setup"
msgstr "最终设置"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:117
#: 7b2af28b13194eecabefa504a26e57aa
msgid ""
"Now that you have the basic parameters tuned you may find you can go back "
"and raise CRUISE_SPEED for faster driving. If you do, then make sure you "
"adjust CRUISE_THROTTLE to suit."
msgstr ""
"完成基本参数调试后，您可能会发现可以提高 CRUISE_SPEED 以实现更快的驾驶。如果这样做，请确保同步调整 CRUISE_THROTTLE。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:121
#: 5abd2fc546724db5ae7102267a6f1b95
msgid ""
"You may also like to lower SPEED_TURN_GAIN to ask the rover to slow down a "
"bit when turning. That would allow for higher speeds when driving straight "
"ahead."
msgstr "您也可以适当降低 SPEED_TURN_GAIN，使 Rover 转弯时稍微减速。这将允许直线行驶时达到更高速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:125
#: ca8c9ccb44cf4675a6c8335dab04c5b0
msgid ""
"There are a number of other parameters that can be used to fine tune your "
"steering once you have completed the basic ones above. Please see the "
":doc:`full parameter list <parameters>` for details."
msgstr "完成上述基本调试后，还有许多其他参数可用于进一步微调转向。详情请参阅 :doc:`完整参数列表 <parameters>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:129
#: ceabe2526f774e5d927e9574a3833015
msgid ""
"Some parameters to pay particular attention to are STEER2SRV_TCONST, "
"STEER2SRV_I, STEER2SRV_D and STEER2SRV_IMAX."
msgstr ""
"需要特别关注的参数包括 STEER2SRV_TCONST、STEER2SRV_I、STEER2SRV_D 和 STEER2SRV_IMAX。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:133
#: d61ca82f749f4e64b4279cc250c0aec2
msgid "Fixing problems with weaving"
msgstr "解决蛇形行驶问题"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:135
#: cf978d4871ed465a892d4af538126262
msgid ""
"A common issue with rovers is that the steering 'weaves', turning from side "
"to side rather than turning smoothly. There can be several possible reasons "
"for this happening."
msgstr "Rover 的常见问题是转向「蛇形行驶」，即来回摆动而不是平滑转向。这可能有以下几种原因。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:139
#: fccd54090b2540b58bbc302a98f3e243
msgid ""
"The first thing you need to work out is if the problem is confined to low "
"speed driving or also affects higher speed driving. If the problem only "
"happens at very low speed (such as when first entering auto on a mission) "
"then the most likely problem is that STEER2SRV_MINSPD is too low. The "
"default is 1.0 m/s, which is quite low, and if your GPS heading isn't very "
"reliable at low speed then you may need to raise that number. Try 2.0 and "
"see if that helps with low speed weaving."
msgstr ""
"首先需要判断问题是仅在低速行驶时出现，还是高速时也存在。如果问题仅在非常低速时出现（例如在任务中首次进入 Auto 时），最可能的原因是 "
"STEER2SRV_MINSPD 设置过低。默认值为1.0米/秒，这相当低；如果低速时 GPS "
"航向不够可靠，可能需要提高该数值。尝试将其设为2.0，看是否能改善低速蛇形问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:147
#: 59430d4f4486438d8a7ed6c61eb9d17c
msgid ""
"If the problem also happens at higher speeds then it is likely to either be "
"the L1 navigation tuning or the steering controller tuning. To fix it you "
"will need to understand how these parameters work."
msgstr "如果问题在高速时也存在，则可能是 L1 导航调试或转向控制器调试的问题。要解决此问题，需要了解这些参数的工作原理。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:151
#: d79366f7450a4a0b92020b6320b1fb4f
msgid ""
"The NAVL1_PERIOD controls how rapidly the L1 navigation controller changes "
"the demanded steering direction. Making this number larger will reduce "
"weaving in AUTO, but it will also mean that you can't steer as accurately "
"around tight corners. Try raising NAVL1_PERIOD in steps of 0.5 until the "
"weaving stops. For most rovers a value between 6.0 and 8.0 is good, but some"
" rovers may need higher values."
msgstr ""
"NAVL1_PERIOD 控制 L1 导航控制器改变期望转向方向的速率。增大此数值将减少 Auto "
"模式下的蛇形，但也意味着无法在急弯处精确转向。以0.5为增量提高 NAVL1_PERIOD，直到蛇形消失。大多数 Rover "
"适合6.0到8.0之间的值，但部分 Rover 可能需要更高的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:158
#: 0bd18d35457b4b87bd01fcf7840ae081
msgid ""
"If raising the NAVL1_PERIOD fixes the weaving but leaves you unable to "
"handle sharp turns in missions then you will instead need to tune the "
"steering controller."
msgstr "如果提高 NAVL1_PERIOD 消除了蛇形，但导致无法处理任务中的急弯，则需要改为调试转向控制器。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:162
#: b8f49915b49744d48af127e7375ab3f9
msgid ""
"In the steering controller there are 3 key parameters that will control "
"weaving:"
msgstr "转向控制器中有3个关键参数会影响蛇形行驶："

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:165
#: 99613d275bbd4cdaa7a7a32706aba9e8
msgid ""
"A smaller STEER2SRV_P will reduce weaving, try reducing it by 0.1 at a time"
msgstr "较小的 STEER2SRV_P 将减少蛇形，每次减少0.1进行尝试"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:167
#: 2a333663410f4194a7c50c6be347d013
msgid ""
"A larger STEER2SRV_D will \"damp\" the weaving, but if you make it too large"
" then you will get high speed oscillation. For example you may find that a "
"value of 0.1 reduces the damping, but a value of 0.2 could cause a high "
"speed oscillation in the steering servo. If you get fast oscillation then "
"reduce the STEER2SRV_D value by 50%."
msgstr ""
"较大的 STEER2SRV_D "
"将「阻尼」蛇形，但设置过大会引起高速振荡。例如，0.1的值可能减少振荡，但0.2可能导致转向舵机高速振荡。如果出现快速振荡，请将 STEER2SRV_D"
" 降低50%。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-steering-and-navigation-for-a-rover.rst:172
#: 1a424b0011db4db58065488c2c22003a
msgid ""
"A larger STEER2SRV_TCONST will slow down the steering controller, which will"
" reduce weaving. Try raising it in steps of 0.1."
msgstr "较大的 STEER2SRV_TCONST 将减慢转向控制器响应速度，从而减少蛇形。以0.1为增量尝试提高。"

